authors:
  - family-names: "Gopalsamy"
    given-names: "Ashwin"
    website: "https://ashwingopalsamy.in"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-2461-636X"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ashwingopalsamy/thirukkural-tamil-dataset"
url: "https://github.com/ashwingopalsamy/thirukkural-tamil-dataset"
abstract: >-
  The Tamil text of all 1,330 kurals of the Thirukkural (stable ids tk:0001 to tk:1330), each with
  the sources that carry it, its verification status, a sha256 of its exact text, and the ruling
  that settled it where sources disagree. Includes chapter and book structure, three public-domain
  English translations (G. U. Pope 1886, W. H. Drew and John Lazarus, V. V. S. Aiyar 1916),
  Parimelazhagar's Tamil commentary, metrical analysis of every seer, scan locations in three
  19th-century printed editions, the ruling ledger and the source registry. No kural text is
  model output.
keywords:
  - Thirukkural
  - Tirukkural
  - Thirukural
  - Thiruvalluvar
  - Tamil
  - Tamil dataset
  - classical Tamil
  - kural venba
  - prosody
  - provenance
  - textual criticism
